  m_text: 'WELCOME!


    This section of the game is rhythm based. Space Guy''s
    side is on the left, and Space Dog''s is on the right! To press Space Guy''s
    button press A (keyboard) or left trigger (controller). For Space Dogs''s button,
    press D (keyboard) or right trigger (controller).


    BEWARE!

    This level
    contains lightning bolts that will speed up the notes and the music for a couple
    of seconds once it reaches the buttons, try to keep up!'
